 "prep_note": "scrubbed", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 teaspoon vegetable oil", "name": "vegetable oil", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "teaspoon", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 small onion, peeled and sliced", "name": "onion", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "peeled and sliced", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 red bell pepper, deseeded and cut into strips", "name": "red bell pepper", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "deseeded and cut into strips", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 yellow bell pepper, deseeded and cut into strips", "name": "yellow bell pepper", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "deseeded and cut into strips", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "3 teaspoons paprika", "name": "paprika", "quantity": 3.0, "unit": "teaspoon", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "2 teaspoons dried oregano", "name": "dried oregano", "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "teaspoon", "prep_note": "or mixed herbs", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "30g plain flour", "name": "plain flour", "quantity": 30.0, "unit": "gram", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 pinch ground black pepper", "name": "black pepper", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "pinch", "prep_note": "ground", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "4 uncooked chicken breasts", "name": "chicken breasts", "quantity": 4.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "skinless, boneless, uncooked", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "300ml vegetable broth", "name": "vegetable broth", "quantity": 300.0, "unit": "milliliter", "prep_note": "or chicken stock, low sodium", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "500g (or one head) broccoli, broken into florets", "name": "broccoli", "quantity": 500.0, "unit": "gram", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}]}, {"slug": "roast-chicken-drumsticks", "title": "Bang-tasty chicken drumsticks", "servings": 4, "prep_time_min": 20, "cook_time_min": 30, "notes": null, "nutrition": {"calories": 404.0, "protein_g": 36.0, "carbs_g": 54.0, "fat_g": 6.5, "sodium_mg": null, "fiber_g": null}, "source_name": "Better Health: Healthier Families recipes", "source_url": "https://www.nhs.uk/healthier-families/recipes/roast-chicken-drumsticks/", "source_license": "Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.", "steps": ["Put the tomato purée, reduced-salt soy sauce and lemon juice into a mixing bowl (not a metal one). Mix well and season with black pepper. Add the chicken drumsticks, turning to coat them in the mixture. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes, or overnight if preferred.", "When ready to cook, preheat the oven to 200C/fan oven 180C/gas mark 6. Arrange the drumsticks in a foil-lined roasting tin and roast for 30 minutes, brushing them with the remaining glaze after 20 minutes.", "While the chicken is roasting, boil the potatoes and carrots in separate saucepans until tender – they will take about 20 minutes. Put the peas on to cook in a little boiling water, 5 minutes before the chicken is ready.", "Drain and mash the potatoes, beat in the milk and season with black pepper. Serve with the chicken drumsticks, carrots and peas."], "lines": [{"raw": "2 teaspoons tomato paste", "name": "tomato paste", "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "teaspoon", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "2 teaspoons soy sauce", "name": "soy sauce", "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "teaspoon", "prep_note": "low sodium", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "2 tablespoons lemon juice", "name": "lemon juice", "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "tablespoon", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "8 chicken drumsticks", "name": "chicken drumsticks", "quantity": 8.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "skinless", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "880g potatoes, peeled and cut into chunks", "name": "potatoes", "quantity": 880.0, "unit": "gram", "prep_note": "peeled and cut into chunks", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "4 carrots (or 320g), sliced", "name": "carrots", "quantity": 4.0, "unit": null, "prep_note": "sliced", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "320g frozen peas", "name": "frozen peas", "quantity": 320.0, "unit": "gram", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "4 tablespoons 1% milk", "name": "1% milk", "quantity": 4.0, "unit": "tablespoon", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}, {"raw": "1 pinch ground black pepper", "name": "black pepper", "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "pinch", "prep_note": "ground", "is_optional": false, "is_alt": false}]}, {"slug": "roasted-veg-and-couscous", "title": "Roasted veg and couscous", "servings": 4, "prep_time_min": 10, "cook_time_min": 30, "notes": null, "nutrition": {"calories": 385.0, "protein_g": 12.9, "carbs_g": 67.7, "fat_g": 5.3, "sodium_mg": null, "fiber_g": null}, "source_name": "Better Health: Healthier Families recipes", "source_url": "https://www.nhs.uk/healthier-families/recipes/roasted-veg-and-couscous/", "source_license": "Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.", "steps": ["Preheat the oven to 200C (fan oven 180C, gas mark 6). Put the pepper, courgette, garlic and onion into a roasting tin, and add the vegetable oil, tossing to coat. Roast for 25 to 30 minutes, stirring and turning after 15 minutes.", "Meanwhile, put the couscous into a heatproof bowl and add the hot stock, stirring to mix. Cover and leave for 10 to 15 minutes to absorb the liquid and swell. Then stir with a fork to fluff up the grains.", "Remove the veg from the oven after about 30 minutes. Add the cherry tomatoes and cooked couscous, then season with some pepper and stir well to mix everything together.", "Return everything to the oven for a further 5 minutes to heat through befo